OL,3,ASea of phones at Christmas event
OL,4,Aprompts backlash
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen BBC London uploaded a video of the
OL,7,FCarnaby Street Christmas lights being
OL,8,Fswitched on last week, the comments
OL,9,Fsection filled with thousands of people
OL,10,Freacting to what they saw.
OL,12,FBut, it wasn't the bright lights or the
OL,13,Fpretty fireworks that they were
OL,14,Freacting to, it was the sea of
OL,15,Fspectators filming on their phones.
OL,17,F"Remember when we used to look at stuff
OL,18,Fdirectly with our eyes? Those were the
OL,19,Fgood old days," said one comment.
OL,20,FAnother simply said: "It's such a sad
OL,21,Fsad sight."
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
