OL,3,ASea of phones at Christmas event
OL,4,Aprompts backlash
OL,5,
OL,6,FFormer EastEnders actress Natalie
OL,7,FCassidy commented: "Why is this piece
OL,8,Fnot mentioning the fact that no-one is
OL,9,Flooking through their eyes at this
OL,10,Fbeautiful display? It's really scary
OL,11,Fand depressing."
